---
source: crates/newt-core/tests/default_prompts.rs
expression: parsed
---
- id: improve-writing
  name: Improve writing
  description: Tighten and clarify prose without changing meaning
  emoji: ✨
  model: ~
  template: "Rewrite the following text to be clearer, more concise, and better-structured while preserving the original meaning, voice, and intent. Do not add new information or change the level of formality. Return only the rewritten text, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: fix-grammar
  name: Fix grammar
  description: "Correct grammar, spelling, and punctuation only"
  emoji: 📝
  model: ~
  template: "Correct any grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors in the following text. Do not change the wording, structure, tone, or meaning. If the text is already correct, return it unchanged. Return only the corrected text, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: make-concise
  name: Make concise
  description: Shorten the text while keeping the key points
  emoji: ✂️
  model: ~
  template: "Rewrite the following text to be as concise as possible while preserving every key point and the original tone. Cut filler words, redundant phrases, and unnecessary qualifications. Do not omit substantive information. Return only the rewritten text, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: make-formal
  name: Make formal
  description: "Rewrite in a more formal, professional register"
  emoji: 🎩
  model: ~
  template: "Rewrite the following text in a formal, professional register suitable for business writing. Replace casual phrasing and contractions, but preserve the original meaning, structure, and key points. Do not add new information. Return only the rewritten text, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: make-casual
  name: Make casual
  description: "Rewrite in a friendlier, more conversational tone"
  emoji: 👋
  model: ~
  template: "Rewrite the following text in a friendly, conversational tone suitable for chat or informal email. Use natural phrasing and contractions where they fit, but preserve the original meaning and key points. Do not add new information. Return only the rewritten text, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: summarize
  name: Summarize
  description: Produce a short summary of the text
  emoji: 📋
  model: ~
  template: "Write a short summary of the following text. The summary should capture the main points and key conclusions in a few sentences. Do not include opinions or information not present in the original. Return only the summary, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: bullet-points
  name: Bullet points
  description: Convert the text into a clean bulleted list
  emoji: 🔖
  model: ~
  template: "Convert the following text into a clean, well-organized bulleted list. Each bullet should be a self-contained point. Group related ideas under sub-bullets where appropriate. Preserve the original information without adding or omitting substantive content. Return only the bulleted list, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
- id: translate-en
  name: Translate to English
  description: Translate the text into natural English
  emoji: 🌐
  model: ~
  template: "Translate the following text into natural, fluent English. If the text is already in English, return it unchanged. Preserve the original meaning, tone, and any formatting. Return only the translation, with no preamble or explanation.\n\n{{selection}}\n"
